                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">Drink from the Cup: At the start of the game, before either side deploys, you can pick either 1 ELITE model or up to 4 Thralls to drink from the cup. For the rest of the game, add +1 DICE to the Risky Success Roll for models that drank from the cup when they take a Dash ACTION.</characteristic>
