                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="87f0-637b-734a-22eb">Deadly Light: Double the number of BLOOD MARKERS placed next to a model by an Injury Roll for an attack made with a Demonic Aura Grenade. In addition, an Injury Roll is made for all models that are within 3&quot; of the target point when the Demonic Aura Grenade explodes, even if interposing terrain blocks the line of sight.</characteristic>
