                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">This piece of equipment can only be carried by an ELITE model. A model equipped with the Saintly Relic gains the Keyword TOUGH but loses the Keyword INFILTRATOR (should it have it) and can never have cover.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
