                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition childId="e144-fd65-dd37-8ba2" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
                        <condition childId="afdf-43aa-a03d-918b" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="3de0-192c-3ec2-51be" field="selections" scope="model" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Bestial Skin Cloak" id="d4f7-37c4-ce83-0e37" hidden="false" typeId="7079-589c-df69-fa7e" typeName="Battlekit">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="3f15-74a1-4d35-3642">Equipment</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="2b32-2f45-9c06-7a77">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">Spirit of the Beast: Once per Turn, you can do one of the following things for a model that as a Bestial Skin Cloak.
* Add +1 DICE to the roll for a Melee Attack made by the model.
* Add +1 INJURY DICE to the roll for a Melee Attack made by the model.
* Add +1 DICE to the Risky Success Roll when the model takes a Dash ACTION.
A Hunter of the Left-Hand Path cannot cast the Oracle Beast Cloak Goetic Spell if it has a Bestial Skin Cloak.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
